// job: oodac CLI dispatch (tokens|ast|check|build|emit-c)
// in:  FsCap + SysCap + argv
// out: stage drivers via imports; process exit
// stage: cli
// openOODA oodac — CLI dispatch; stages live in imported modules
// Commands: tokens|ast|check|build|emit-c <file> [out]

